docs {
  # Book catalogue

  A `Book` is a reader's private catalogue entry (a title they own or want to track), not a
  physical copy. Every endpoint requires `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>` and only ever sees
  the caller's own, non-deleted books.

  Run the folder in order. **Register books reader** creates its own disposable account, so this
  folder does not depend on the Auth folder (which logs its session out). Email, password and
  tokens live only in Bruno runtime variables.

  Contract: `docs/api-contract.md` ("Books").
}
